## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **Full Quality Gate**: `npm run verify` 100% GREEN — build clean, unit 520/520, integration 300/300, master 23/23, impeccable 7/7.
- **finance-core-stress** (`tests/stress/finance-core-stress.ts`): 57 passed / 0 failed across 11 suites, including new **S11 Purchase Revert** (top-up 5000 -> purchase 2599 -> refund -> ledger `refund_credit` balanceAfter 5000 -> order 'refunded' -> double-revert idempotent no-op -> non-wallet order reverts with zero wallet movement -> fractional refund rejected).
- **checkout-add-card-stress** (`tests/stress/checkout-add-card-stress.ts`): 31 passed / 0 failed (bare component instantiation + input shadowing; fuzz oracle dedupes on (brand, last4) to mirror service dedupe).
- **responsive-boundary-stress** 30/30 and **ui-ux-polish-stress** 37/37 green earlier this session.
- **Integration Suites 22 & 23** (`tests/integration/integration-tests.spec.ts`): 22 = finance core (ledger/intents/idempotency audits); 23 = paid-game revert (additive 'refunded', `revertOrder(orderId: string)`/`refundWallet(...)` in interface + mock, both removal flows orchestrate with `refundWallet`/`revertOrder` ordered before `removeFromLibrary`, free path intact, wallet-refund toast text).
- **Round-trip currency test caught a real bug**: `convertCurrency` originally multiplied KHR->USD instead of dividing; fixed with a `rateFactor` and now round-trip verified.

---

## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **TestBed/JIT component rendering in Node harnesses**: initTestEnvironment + `ɵresolveComponentResources` + `--experimentalDecorators` fights were abandoned; bare instantiation (`new Component()` + `Injector.create`/`runInInjectionContext` + `Object.defineProperty` getters to shadow `input()` signals) is the reliable pattern for stress harnesses.
- **Compile flags matter**: repo test scripts compile WITHOUT `--strict`, which breaks discriminated-union narrowing — use typed locals (`const result: TopUpWalletResult = {...}`) or `.some((m: any) => ...)`. Component-importing harnesses need `--strict --experimentalDecorators`.
- **Observable union TS2349**: type the intermediate (`const refund$: Observable<FinanceWallet | null>`) instead of subscribing to `A | B` directly; import `FinanceWallet` from `core/data/tokens`, not finance.model.
- **Bash heredoc/sed insertion of template literals**: mangled `refundWallet` once (unterminated backtick + lost `appendLedgerEntry`); repaired via Read + Edit tool. Lesson: multi-line TS with backticks must go through Write/Edit, never shell interpolation.
- **Suite 23 placement**: inserting before the finance-core suite's variable declarations caused ReferenceError at assert time — suites must be appended after their dependencies.

---

