1. **Manage-methods-link hover invisible in light theme**: `.manage-methods-link:hover { color: #FFFFFF }` at `purchase-confirm-modal.component.css:509` has NO light-theme override (confirmed on disk today). Fix: add `:host-context([data-theme="light"]) .manage-methods-link:hover { color: #005A9E; }` (Steam blue hover family, per the earlier session's pattern) + a stress/integration audit so it can't regress. NOTE: the prior session file (2026-08-30 impeccable-craft) claims this was fixed, but that fix was lost during a CSS reconstruction (sed redirect wiped ~77 lines of uncommitted work); current disk has no override.
2. **Payment & Wallet page not showing a saved Visa** (user screenshot): static wiring verified correct (single root `PAYMENTS_DATA` via `useClass` in app.config.ts:25, effect -> loadData). Suspected stale localStorage (screenshot showed NEXO-CYBER-2026 voucher not in current seeds). Repro harness first, then fix per findings.
3. **Remove KHR fully from UI**: last remnant is the account-payment wallet card — `account-payment.component.html:69` `<span class="khr-approx">≈ {{ khrBalance() }} KHR</span>` + `khrBalance` computed at `account-payment.component.ts:61` (`approxKhr`). PayWay sheet template is already KHR-free. Keep finance-core `Currency`/`convertCurrency` as data layer; Bakong KHQR method naming stays.

